    "en": {
      "text": "<solar/>Ignition Kills grant Grenade Energy based on the <link Enemy Rank [#CombatantClassifications] /> of the killed targets:\n• Tier 1 (T1) Minors: 8%\n• T2 Minors, T1 Elites: 12.25%\n• T3 Minors, T2 Elites: 16.5%\n• Players: 20.75%\n• T4 Minors, T3 Elites, and higher: 25%\n\n#ChunkEnergyScalars",
